  "details": "Currently trying to make a DataList or DataDictionary UdonSynced will give the error \"'VRC.SDK3.Data.DataList' is not supported by Udon sync\".\n\nPlease add support for syncing DataList and DataDictionary, it would make them a whole lot more useful, especially since there's no good way to otherwise represent a dictionary/hashtable with syncing!\n\nThe alternative would be converting the lists in arrays and serializing the dictionaries in a json string but this will make code unnecessarily messy and complicated",
